# Gabriel Improved PoV Doc Sync

- Read `Custom/Scripts/Gabriel/features/improved-pov/FEATURE.md`,
  `Custom/Scripts/Gabriel/FEATURE.md`, and
  `Custom/Scripts/Gabriel/docs/RUNTIME-OPTIMIZATION-HISTORY.md` before changing
  this area.
- Use `features/improved-pov/FEATURE.md` references to pull adjacent Gabriel
  docs when Improved PoV changes cross into head-hide or passenger behavior.
- Current optimization notes: render hooks register only while the effect is
  active, and hair refresh uses explicit loops instead of render-path LINQ.
- Update `Custom/Scripts/Gabriel/features/improved-pov/FEATURE.md` in the same
  turn whenever behavior, file ownership, load paths, settings, dependencies,
  or optimization assumptions change.
- If the change crosses into another Gabriel area, update both adjacent docs.
